Once you get back to an altar, consider going for spellbooks.
Gifted spellbooks favor schools that you can advance, and
for a Valk that's a very limited number.  It narrows the
likely books down a lot.  The book you want is cone of
cold.  Valk's get a bonus in their odds of casting that one
spell so you'll be able to take off spell interfering armor
and make an ice bridge whereever you like even if it takes
several tries per cast.  But that's in the future at this
point.

